From 0b234c21f16c4d133053e850b2dc63922a093c1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shahir <shahir@hitechkallara.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 10:13:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix broken nav links, silent form failures, and duplicated
 site data

Bugs
- Header dropdowns for eGov and Travel linked to 12 service keys that do not
  exist on the target pages (?service=psc, aadhaar, visa-australia, tour-dubai,
  ...). Every one landed with nothing pre-selected. Nav is now generated from
  the same arrays the pages render, so the keys cannot drift again.
- /travel gated the travel-date and traveller-count fields on
  selectedService === 'bookings', a key that is not in the list. Both fields
  were permanently hidden. Now gated on services that involve a journey.
- /contact validated, displayed "Message sent", and sent nothing anywhere.
  There is no backend; it now delivers via WhatsApp like the other forms.
- /institutions only reached us if the user clicked WhatsApp on the
  confirmation screen. Now fires on submit.
- /service, /security, /travel, /online-services generated a reference number
  and never rendered it. Shared FormConfirmation panel added to all four.
- generateReference could collide: random(100-999) + counter then .slice(-3)
  turned 1004 into "004". Rewritten with a session block plus a counter.
- Header called setState synchronously inside an effect (React 19 lint error).
  Guarded with a ref so it only fires on an actual navigation.

Single source of truth
- data/business.ts, data/partners.ts, data/services.ts, data/navigation.ts.
  Address, phone numbers, hours and the partner list were duplicated across
  six files.
- Landline standardised to +91 472 2960076. The displayed "+91 472 296007"
  was six digits and not dialable; the tel: link already used seven.
  Confirmed correct by the owner.
- Opening hours standardised to 9:00 AM - 7:30 PM. The homepage published
  this while the footer and contact page said "to be confirmed".
  Confirmed correct by the owner.

Routing and SEO
- /about rendered app/history/page.tsx verbatim. Removed, 308 to /history.
- /history added to sitemap.ts, /about removed.
- Added metadata to /travel, /online-services, /institutions, /contact, which
  shipped with no title or description.

Content
- Removed unverifiable claims: "saving up to 70% in repair costs" and
  "one of a kind in Kerala".

Cleanup
- WhatsApp SVG was pasted inline four times, now components/BrandIcons.tsx.
- Emoji phone icons in the header and footer replaced with lucide.
- Off-palette hex #3A6351 and #5A6D63 on /contact replaced with tokens.
- Removed dead imports (WrenchIcon, buildServiceWhatsAppUrl, five on /history).
- Header 415 -> 194 lines, app/page.tsx 447 -> 162 (split into components/home).

Verified: next build passes, tsc clean, eslint 0 errors 0 warnings, all routes
200, /about redirects, 35 nav deep links checked against the service registry
with 0 broken.
